3
00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:11.450
In Japan, the first thing that comes up if you Google

4
00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.630
"Conan," is an anime character named Detective Conan.

5
00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:17.664
