22
00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:12.703
Yes.

23
00:01:12.703 --> 00:01:17.484
How to be very polite and proper while I'm in Japan, yes?

24
00:01:17.484 --> 00:01:18.986 line:15%
Okay.
Konnichiwa.

25
00:01:18.986 --> 00:01:19.819 line:15%
Konnichiwa.
Konnichiwa.

26
00:01:19.819 --> 00:01:20.980
